#: ../initial_setup/common.py:140
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to quit the configuration process?\n"
"You might end up with an unusable system if you do. Unless the License "
"agreement is accepted, the system will be rebooted."
msgstr ""
"Sidd Dir sécher, datt Dir de Konfiguratiounsvirgang ofbrieche wëllt?\n"
"Äert System kéint doduerch onbenotztbar sinn. Wann de Lizenzaccord net "
"akzeptéiert gëtt, da gëtt Äert System nei gestart."

#: ../initial_setup/common.py:144
